      "writtenOn": "2025-02-15T23:01:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This method `removeLocalNetAccess` just removes the entry from the map irrespective of whether it is a allow rule or block rule. Hence the name. \nAdded comment here for better clarity.\nHowever I agree the name could be more clear like \u0027removeLocalNetAccessEntry\u0027. Does this name work? \nAnd is it fine to change the name in separate CL?",
